    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This new car interface iCar is unique in that it revolutionizes user interaction and allows him or her to interact with other aspect of their car via smart phone. Through innovations such as the\r\nphone as a key and heads-up display, driving becomes easier to manage and multi-task with.\r\nThrough safety features such as the disabling of the phone, physiological sensors, and warnings\r\nof impending danger the roads become a much safer place to drive. Because of the features of the\r\niCar, multi-tasking can be accomplished correctly, efficiently, and safely. With the help of the\r\niCar, frustration, danger, and boredom will never be synonymous with driving again.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
